    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note: Hot and Lovely : Seduction is a &quot;normal&quot; version of other games with the same content! Please do not purchase it again!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557750/extras/c45a494226859ccf36d407afbff74d5c.avif?t=1752826065\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hot and Lovely: Seduction is a game that combines classic match-3 gameplay with beautiful girls! Players will unlock the beautiful illustrations of several beautiful girls with distinct personalities by eliminating colored blocks, and experience the heart-moving moments with them.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22 beautiful illustrations: Delicate and beautiful illustrations, from girls' daily playfulness to private ambiguity\ud83e\udd70</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557750/extras/bb4a66109bfd70c1aec562cf17966051.avif?t=1752826065\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 charming female characters: Each beautiful girl has a unique personality and background, is she a strong sister or an obedient kitten? \ud83e\udd2d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557750/extras/0da8e3177886d50ff4ad46d88e9aa4c6.poster.avif?t=1752826065\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557750/extras/0da8e3177886d50ff4ad46d88e9aa4c6.webm?t=1752826065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557750/extras/0da8e3177886d50ff4ad46d88e9aa4c6.mp4?t=1752826065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><